stateDiagram-v2
  title: UsageRings - Antigravity / Grok / Claude via official CLIs (--source cli)
  [*] --> Waiting
  Waiting: Waiting for refresh
  Hidden: Ring off (not read)
  Asking: Asking the official CLI
  Pending: Claude - waiting for first value
  Shown: Ring shows usage
  Notice: Ring shows a setup/error notice
  Waiting --> Hidden: refresh runs [ring is off]
  Waiting --> Asking: refresh runs [ring is on]
  Asking --> Pending: no cached Claude value yet
  Asking --> Asking: the CLI times out once, retry
  Asking --> Shown: the CLI returns usage
  Pending --> Shown: the CLI returns usage
  Asking --> Notice: CLI missing / signed out / times out again
  Pending --> Notice: CLI missing / signed out / times out
  Shown --> Waiting: you turn the ring on/off, or sign in/out of the CLI
  Notice --> Waiting: you turn the ring on/off, or install / sign in to the CLI
  Hidden --> Waiting: you turn the ring on, or the CLI changes
